&lt;p&gt;I never thought I&#039;d see that beast again.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Defeating it had been my purpose, my goal, and yet here it was years later, resurrected and stronger than ever. And with it came other monsters, crawling from the depths of the earth to join its queen. With my task force&#039;s resources spread thin, I almost lost hope.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But the Foundation had something up its sleeve. It always does.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We were going to finish our decades-long war once and for all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:75%;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;-Testimony from Perseus Rosales, Captain of Mobile Task Force Eta-5 (&amp;quot;Jäeger Bombers&amp;quot;)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
