&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; padding-left: 36px; background-color: #F3F3F3&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Still a little in awe of this, to be honest.&lt;/em&gt; [McInnis, Dr. A.]&lt;/td&gt;
