&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; padding: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;09/01/2015 - 09/08/2015:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr. A. Zlatá claims SCP-5109 for use as the password to an information retrieval system. He is subsequently killed when a scheduling mishap results in his presence in Site-43 Acroamatic Abatement Facility AAF-D during a cascade containment breach event on 09/08/2015.&lt;/td&gt;
