&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; padding: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;09/09/2019:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-5056&quot;&gt;SCP-5056-A&lt;/a&gt; screams a string of characters at SCP-5056-B while the latter is showering. SCP-5056-B recounts the event to A. Torosyan, Janitorial and Maintenance Chief for Site-43, and immediately forgets the characters upon so doing. SCP-5109 is returned to Chief Veiksaar after an interval of thirty-six months.&lt;/td&gt;
