&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum:&lt;/strong&gt; Proposals to decommission SCP-5109 have been rejected, as it is unclear whether terminating its present keeper would permanently destroy the anomaly or cause it to manifest in some other context — potentially outside of containment, or Foundation notice.&lt;/p&gt;
